              "id": "1763407466532_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Input:\n {{$context.$nodes.GATHER_DATA.$output.result}}\n\nGenerate actionable insights for each role where many users are assigned using above input data: \n  title:\"<User> - <Number of Incidents> access violations - <Number of Controls> controls violated\".\n  followUpCommand:  ora.Invoke(navigateToUserViolations, <UserName>|<displayname>, <position> (Reports to <manager>)).\n  actionText must be \"Review Risk\".\n  shortDescription that describes the risk and states the recommendation\n  PRIORITIZE this action based on following:\n    CRITICAL - If a user has a lot of incidents\n    HIGH - If a user has relatively fewer but still significant number of incidents\n    LOW - If a user has fewer number of incidents\nLimit to only top 3 actions\n\nIMPORTANT: The first parameter MUST be the exact \"UserName\" field value (e.g., \"ABRAHAM.MASON\" in uppercase with dots), NOT the \"displayname\" field. The second parameter should be the \"displayname\" field value.\n\nCRITICAL: Do NOT use quotes (single or double) around the ora.Invoke parameters. Write it exactly as: ora.Invoke(navigateToUserViolations, pappu.sri|Pappu Sri, position info) - NO quotes.\n\nRefer to the current item in {{$context.$nodes.GATHER_DATA.$output.result}} to retrieve the values of UserName, displayname, position, manager"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Gather Data",
            "returnType": "array",
            "sourceCode": "const userViolSummaryArray = $context.$nodes.GET_TOP_5_USER_VIOLATION_HIGH_LEVEL_SUMMARY.$output.output ;\n\n/*\n[{\"UserName\":\"ABRAHAM.MASON\",\"Controls\":\"6410: Create Suppliers and Create Purchase Orders,6870: Enter Journals and Post Journal Entry\",\"NumControls\":2,\"NumIncidents\":124,\"position\":\"Procurement Analyst\",\"manager\":\"Louis Farrell\",\"displayname\":\"Abraham Mason\"},\n{\"UserName\":\"Ana.Lima\",\"Controls\":\"6080: Create Purchase Orders and Define Procurement Approval Routing Rules,5810: Approve Payables Invoices and Create Payments,5220: Enter Accounts Receivables Invoice and Enter Customer Receipts,4053: Manage Employee and Manage Compensation,7553: Post Journal Entry and Manage Journal Approval Rules,9803: Sensitive Accounting Period Status Privileges\",\"NumControls\":6,\"NumIncidents\":109,\"position\":\"Payables Clerk\",\"manager\":\"Ted Brown\",\"displayname\":\"Ana Lima\"},\n{\"UserName\":\"Superhcm.user06\",\"Controls\":\"4074: Manage Employee and Manage Time and Labor,4059: Manage Person and Manage Payroll\",\"NumControls\":2,\"NumIncidents\":102,\"position\":\"HR Time and Labor Specialist \",\"manager\":\"Bill Greene\",\"displayname\":\"Superhcm User06\"},\n{\"UserName\":\"fin_archive_qa\",\"Controls\":\"6870: Enter Journals and Post Journal Entry\",\"NumControls\":1,\"NumIncidents\":102,\"position\":\"Accountant\",\"manager\":\"Stuart Lively\"},\n{\"UserName\":\"TM-MFITZIMMONS\",\"Controls\":\"4074: Manage Employee and Manage Time and Labor,4059: Manage Person and Manage Payroll\",\"NumControls\":2,\"NumIncidents\":97,\"position\":\"Payroll Analyst\",\"manager\":\"Clive Strauss\"}];\n*/\n\nreturn userViolSummaryArray ;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1763407352667"
          },
          "code": "GATHER_DATA",
          "id": "1763408461797",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
